      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Play the active Spades suit, rank 2, or any 8. You may draw one card
        and end your turn whenever Draw is shown.


        Every shown action is
        legal:

        [OK] Play 10S - Matches the discard by same Spades suit.

        [OK]
        Play 4S - Matches the discard by same Spades suit.

        [OK] Play 5S
        - Matches the discard by same Spades suit.

        [OK] Play 7S - Matches
        the discard by same Spades suit.

        [OK] Draw - Draw one card and end
        your turn; drawing is a legal choice.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
